Orc Hatchets	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Orc Hatchets","wikiPath":"/Orc_Hatchets","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Kelethin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dill Fireshine","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Orc Hatchet","qty":2,"wikiPath":"/Orc_Hatchet"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Rusty Short Sword","item":"Rusty Short Sword","wikiPath":"/Rusty_Short_Sword"},{"text":"Rusty Spear","item":"Rusty Spear","wikiPath":"/Rusty_Spear"},{"text":"Rusty Two Handed Sword","item":"Rusty Two Handed Sword","wikiPath":"/Rusty_Two_Handed_Sword"},{"text":"Tarnished Bastard Sword","item":"Tarnished Bastard Sword","wikiPath":"/Tarnished_Bastard_Sword"},{"text":"Tarnished Scimitar","item":"Tarnished Scimitar","wikiPath":"/Tarnished_Scimitar"}],"card":{"title":"Orc Hatchets","lines":["Minimum Level: 2","Classes: Bard, Druid, Paladin, Ranger, Rogue, Shadow Knight, Shaman, Warrior","Related Zones: Greater Faydark","Related NPCs: Orc Pawn (Crushbone), orc hatchetman","Faction note: You must have Amiable faction to complete this quest."]},"links":["Greater Faydark","Dill Fireshine","Bard","Druid","Paladin","Ranger","Rogue","Shadow Knight","Shaman","Warrior","Orc Pawn (Crushbone)","Orc hatchetman","Rusty Short Sword","Rusty Spear","Rusty Two Handed Sword","Tarnished Bastard Sword","Tarnished Scimitar","Orc Hatchet","Clerics of Tunare","Faydarks Champions","King Tearis Thex","Soldiers of Tunare","Crushbone Orcs","Orc Runner (Kelethin)"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Dill Fireshine","text":"Welcome to the treetops and the home of Faydark's Champions. We are the skilled rangers of the Faydarks. You are safe in Kelethin, but watch yourself upon the forest floor. I hear the [blue meanies] have been on the rise."},{"npc":"Dill Fireshine","text":"That is a little name I have given the Crushbone Orcs. It appears they have increased their numbers. The Emerald Warriors are charged with our defense against them. We rangers are to seek out the [orc saboteurs]."},{"npc":"Dill Fireshine","text":"As others move to battle the orc armies, we have word that the orc pawns have been sent into the woods to damage the great trees which support Kelethin. We shall employ the talents of our young rangers to halt their efforts. I currently seek those who will [hunt the orc pawns]."},{"npc":"Dill Fireshine","text":"Go to the forest floor and seek out the orc pawns. Within their ranks can sometimes be found orc hatchetmen. They carry orc hatchets which you must return and I shall reward you for every two orc hatchets and perhaps offer you a weapon in return, should we have any to spare at the time."},{"npc":"Dill Fireshine","text":"I expect to receive TWO orc hatchets."},{"npc":"Dill Fireshine","text":"Fantastic work!! Your actions shall earn you the respect of all Fier'Dal! Take this as a small bounty for your deed. We have heard of [Crushbone allies] who wish our demise."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T09:06:38.401Z","outOfEra":false}
Werewolf Hunters	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Werewolf Hunters","wikiPath":"/Werewolf_Hunters","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"North Karana","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Fixxin Followig","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Faction","item":"Faction","wikiPath":"/Faction"},{"text":"Fixxin Followigs Silvery Blades","item":"Fixxin Followigs Silvery Blades","wikiPath":"/Fixxin_Followigs_Silvery_Blades"}],"card":{"title":"Werewolf Hunters","lines":["Minimum Level: All","Classes: All","Related Zones: North Karana","Related NPCs: None"]},"links":["North Karana","Fixxin Followig","Faction","Fixxin Followigs Silvery Blades","Silver Bar","Karana Residents","Guards of Qeynos","Priests of Life","Knights of Thunder"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Fixxin Followig","text":"Hail, ______! Fixxin is my moniker. Nice ta see ya. I am a member of the [Fangbreakers] and we are hunting [werewolves]. We run into lots of other [creepies] out here as well."},{"npc":"Fixxin Followig","text":"Fangbreakers? You have not heard of us? We are the best [werewolf] hunters there are!"},{"npc":"Fixxin Followig","text":"Those blasted fiends hide among normal folk during the day, but at night their bloodlust is set free on an innocent populace. Some claim there is a cure for their condition but the only one we know of is an [enchanted blade] through the bellies of the beasts."},{"npc":"Fixxin Followig","text":"Interested in an enchanted blade? You wouldn't be planning on hunting the moon beasts without a strong. well-oiled party to back you up, now, would you? Well, in any case, I'll gladly lend you a copy of my book, Fixxin Followigs Silvery Blades, if you will fetch me a bar of silver. My supply is running low and our weapons are in need of repair after the deaths of so many lycanthropes."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T09:06:39.492Z","outOfEra":false}
