Wenbie's Muffins	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Wenbie's Muffins","wikiPath":"/Wenbie's_Muffins","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"South Qeynos","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Guard Wenbie","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Brass Ring","item":"Brass Ring","wikiPath":"/Brass_Ring"},{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Faction"},{"text":"Minor Coin"}],"card":{"title":"Wenbie's Muffins","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: None","Related NPCs: None"]},"links":["Muffin Quests","Qeynos","Guard Wenbie","Brass Ring","Guards of Qeynos","Antonius Bayle","Corrupt Qeynos Guards","Circle Of Unseen Hands","Merchants of Qeynos"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Guard Wenbie","text":"Hello, ______. What brings you to Qeynos? Must be the mighty fine muffins over at [Voleen's Bakery]. I just love those muffins!"},{"npc":"Guard Wenbie","text":"Oh, it will be easier for us both if I just show you where it is. Follow me. But be quick about it, because I have to get back to my patrol."},{"npc":"Guard Wenbie","text":"Oh, thank you so much. I do get hungry on patrol. Here, please take this reward for your kindness."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:36:58.335Z","outOfEra":false}
The Traitor	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Traitor","wikiPath":"/The_Traitor","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"West Freeport","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Sir Lucan D`Lere","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Coin (10 silver - 7 gold)"}],"card":{"title":"The Traitor","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: Message Intercept","Related NPCs: Guard Alayle","Faction note: Return the Slashed Militia Tunic to D'Lere. Dubious faction was sufficient for this turn-in."]},"links":["Freeport","Sir Lucan D`Lere","Message Intercept","Guard Alayle","Slashed Militia Tunic"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Sir Lucan Dlere","text":"So I see you decided to bring me the message. Good. I would hate to have to hunt you down. It could have gotten really messy and I hate reading bloodstained messages. Well it seems Antonius Bayle and the Knights of Truth have begun an alliance. And it sounds as though I may have a traitor among my guards. If you wish to switch your allegiance to Freeport, then find me this traitor. Bring me his militia tunic. Try to keep the blood from staining it."},{"npc":"Sir Lucan D`Lere","text":"So, it was Alayle! He was of no importance to us. He knew nothing. I thank you for assisting the Freeport Militia. My men shall keep an eye out for you. Unfortunately, so will the Knights of Truth. Might I suggest you spend less time in North Freeport?"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:36:59.426Z","outOfEra":false}
